@startuml
title Content Cooker Tool — finite offline publication
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "Invoker" as I
participant "Content Cooker Tool" as C
participant "Private snapshot / processing" as S
participant "Signing adapter" as K
participant "Release Publisher" as P
I -> C : immutable job; authoring root; key reference
C -> C : validate job and tool closure
C -> S : capture private immutable snapshot; reject unsafe paths
S --> C : validated input closure
C -> S : required processing gates; deterministic role Pack Cores
S --> C : authority pack + client pack + processing record
C -> K : sign reciprocal release envelopes
K --> C : signed role packs (no secret export)
C -> P : make complete release durable; publish release entry atomically
alt identical release already published
  P --> C : idempotent existing release
else same identity, different release
  P --> C : Identity Conflict
else ambiguous publication
  P --> C : failure; block unsafe retry
else new complete release published
  P --> C : publication identity
end
C -> I : atomically publish job result; owned cleanup; terminal exit
note over C,P
  No partial release activation. Release publication precedes success result.
  Failure before publication cleans only owned work; never deletes another release.
  No ProcessReady, Admission or live Controlled LAN service.
end note
@enduml
